@startuml
title CarRentalMSE800 – Class Diagram

interface IUserRepo
interface ICarRepo
interface IBookingRepo

class UserRepo
class CarRepo
class BookingRepo

class AuthService
class CarService
class BookingService

abstract class PricingStrategy {
  +quote(daily: float, start: str, end: str): float
}
class FlatDaily
class WeekendSurcharge {
  -factor: float
  +quote(...): float
}

class EventBus {
  +subscribe(event: str, handler)
  +emit(event: str, payload)
}
class Database {
  +connect(): Connection
  +init_schema(): void
}

class User {
  id: int
  first_name: str
  last_name: str
  email: str
  phone: str
  password: str
  role: str  // 'admin' | 'customer'
}
class Car {
  id: int
  brand: str
  model: str
  color: str
  year: int
  mileage: int
  available_now: int
  min_rent_days: int
  max_rent_days: int
  price_per_day: float
}
class Booking {
  id: int
  user_id: int
  car_id: int
  start_date: str
  end_date: str
  total_price: float
  status: str  // pending|approved|rejected|returned
  notes: str
}

class App {
  -current_user
  +parser
  +cmd_login(...)
  +cmd_register(...)
  +cmd_list_cars(...)
  +cmd_request(...)
  +cmd_pending(...)
  +cmd_approve(...)
  +cmd_reject(...)
  +cmd_return(...)
  +cmd_import_cars(...)
}

IUserRepo <|.. UserRepo
ICarRepo <|.. CarRepo
IBookingRepo <|.. BookingRepo

AuthService --> IUserRepo
CarService --> ICarRepo
BookingService --> IBookingRepo
BookingService --> ICarRepo
BookingService --> PricingStrategy

PricingStrategy <|-- FlatDaily
PricingStrategy <|-- WeekendSurcharge

EventBus ..> BookingService : emits\n(requested/approved/\nrejected/returned)
Database ..> UserRepo
Database ..> CarRepo
Database ..> BookingRepo

App --> AuthService
App --> CarService
App --> BookingService

@enduml
